Dialogue: 10,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}GHI mede a potência solar recebida por\Nunidade de área horizontal.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.00,0:00:11.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Aqui temos um metro quadrado. A unidade do\NGHI é watt por metro quadrado.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.00,0:00:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}A direta normal, DNI, é medida num plano\Nperpendicular aos raios, como este.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.00,0:00:25.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Multiplicamos a DNI pelo cosseno do ângulo\Ncom a vertical e somamos a luz difusa.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.00,0:00:30.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Durante o dia, a luz varia. À noite, o GHI\Nsolar zera.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.00,0:00:34.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}As nuvens alteram a luz e a curva.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.00,0:00:38.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}O histórico registra esses ciclos e as\Nmudanças da atmosfera.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.00,0:00:42.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}A previsão tenta antecipar a continuação\Ndessa curva.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.00,0:00:47.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Prever o recurso solar pode apoiar\Nestimativas de geração fotovoltaica.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.00,0:00:49.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}Essas estimativas podem orientar compras
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.27,0:00:52.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,985)\fs44\c&H00FBF6F3&\b0\fad(100,100)}de energia, armazenamento e horários de\Nconsumo.
